{"speciesId":176,"names":{"fr":"Togetic","es":"Togetic","en":"Togetic","ja":"トゲチック"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, car­ ing people and shower them with happiness."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It grows dispirit­ ed if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Although it does not flap its wings very much, it can stay up in the air as it tags along after its trainer."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"TOGETIC is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When the POKéMON spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"TOGETIC is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When the POKéMON spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When it spots someone who is pure of heart, a TOGETIC appears and shares its happiness with that person."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is said to appear in front of kindly people to scatter a glowing down called “joy dust.”"},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is said to appear in front of kindly people to scatter a glowing down called “joy dust.”"},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind­ hearted people."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il parcourt le monde pour distribuer de la joie aux êtres bons."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind- hearted people."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il parcourt le monde pour distribuer de la joie aux êtres bons."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind- hearted people."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind- hearted people."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind- hearted people."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se démoralise vite s’il n’est pas avec des gens sympathiques. Il peut léviter sans battre des ailes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si no está con gente amable, se entristece. Puede flotar en el aire sin mover las alas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"優しい人の そばに いないと 元気が 出なくなってしまう。 羽を動かさずに 空に浮かべる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit qu’il n’apparaît qu’aux cœurs purs et qu’il leur apporte la joie et le bonheur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Dicen que aparece entre gentes cuidadosas y de buen corazón, a quienes inunda de felicidad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"心優しい 人の 前に 幸せを もたらすため 姿を 現すと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On raconte que Togetic est un Pokémon qui porte chance. Si ce Pokémon remarque quelqu’un doté d’un cœur pur, il apparaît et partage son bonheur avec la personne en question."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que Togetic es un Pokémon que trae buena suerte y que, si detecta a alguien que es puro de corazón, sale para compartir su alegría con él."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Togetic is said to be a Pokémon that brings good fortune. When the Pokémon spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"幸運を もたらす ポケモンと いわれている。 純粋な 心の 持ち主を みつけると 姿を あらわし 幸せを 分け与える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On raconte que Togetic est un Pokémon qui porte chance. Si ce Pokémon remarque quelqu’un doté d’un cœur pur, il apparaît et partage son bonheur avec la personne en question."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dicen que Togetic es un Pokémon que trae buena suerte y que, si detecta a alguien que es puro de corazón, sale para compartir su alegría con él."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Togetic is said to be a Pokémon that brings good fortune. When the Pokémon spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"幸運を もたらす ポケモンと いわれている。 純粋な 心の 持ち主を みつけると 姿を あらわし 幸せを 分け与える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On dit qu’il se montre aux personnes dotées d’un cœur pur pour leur apporter joie et bonheur."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Dicen que se le aparece a la gente de buen corazón y la inunda de felicidad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"心優しい 人の 前に 幸せを もたらすため 姿を 現すと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon est capable de léviter sans battre des ailes. Il est vite dém